        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.17.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 17:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu shi iwe, ahabw'enki noocwera mwene Sho orubanja? Nari shi noogayira ki mwene Sho? Ahakuba twena turyayemerera omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'eiramuriro ekya Ruhanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.2.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Fil 2:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.45.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 45:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo okuruga hati turekye kucwererana emanja; kureka buri muntu omuriitwe ahamize kimwe okutateeza mwene Ishe ntsibo, nari okukora ekirikumugwisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.15.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 15:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "TIT.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tit 1:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nimmanya, kandi niinyikiririza kimwe omuri Mukama waitu Yesu ntu: Tihariho kintu kyona ekyahangirwe nikizira ahabwakyo; kwonka omuntu ku ateekateeka ngu nikizira, ahariwe kizira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.8.11+1CO.8.12+1CO.8.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 8:11-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwene Sho ku araabe naakorwa kubi ebi orikurya, nooba otakigyendera mu kukunda. Otahwerekyereza n'eby'okurya byawe ogwo ou Kristo yaafeereire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo otajumisa ekirungi kyawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manya, obukama bwa Ruhanga ti by'okurya, nari eby'okunywa, kureka okuhikiirira n'obusingye n'okushemererwa omu Mwoyo Orikwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba oheereza atyo Kristo, niwe ashemeza Ruhanga, kandi asiimwe n'abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.12.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 12:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.15.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo tukuratire ebirikureeta obusingye n'okwombekana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutashiisha omurimo gwa Ruhanga ahabw'eby'okurya. Omu mazima byona bishemeire; kwonka ni kibi omuntu kugwisa abandi ahabw'ebi arikurya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni kirungi okutarya nyama, nari okunywa viinyo, nari okukora ekintu kyona ekirikuteeza mwene Sho entsibo, nari okumugwisa nari okumumaramu amaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
